### Create account
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 101 }

### Get account (paste the id from the response above)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/accounts/PASTE-ID-HERE

### Bad id, should be 400
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/accounts/abc

### Unknown id, should be 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/accounts/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Transfer
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fromAccountId": "ACCOUNT-A-ID", "toAccountId": "ACCOUNT-B-ID", "amount": "1000.00" }